<title>USA: AT&amp;T unit wins $125 mln U.S. defense contract.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T unit wins $125 mln U.S. defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A unit of AT&amp;T Corp unit was awarded a U.S. military contract with a ceiling of $125 million for work on global defense information video services, the Defense Department said on Friday.</p>
</text>
